# The first session in library/initial-journey.json. Its structure follows the
# original Wave I Orientation: establish the listening setup and core tools,
# perform Resonant Tuning, move from waking awareness to Focus 3, remain there
# briefly, then return. It deliberately does not use relax-10 — and it returns
# on the tape's own three-count, not the ten-count out of Focus 10.

@title    Focus 3 — Light Relaxation
@level    F3
@ending   return
@pan      right
@seed     1003
@verbosity 3

surf 0.55
use opening
use comfort
use orientation
use ocean

surf 0.30
use conversion-box
use affirmation

surf 0.18
use resonant-tuning

surf 0.0
use climb-f1-f3
use briefing-f3

hold 300

use return-three
